---
description: Start every agent session from the brain contract
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is part of a brain whose contract lives outside it. With the brain checked
out, read `CONTRACT.md` in the brain root first (on the usual layout
`../<BRAIN_FOLDER>/CONTRACT.md`) and follow its bootstrap, then read `brain/README.md` and
`brain/STATE.md` here. Without the brain, read `brain/README.md` and `brain/RULES.md`.

This rule is a pointer only. Do not add behaviour here; it belongs in the brain's `RULES.md`
files.
